nt-size:9.0pt\">0.4849916<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"80\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:59.75pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:10.2pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">0.02346374<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"79\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:59.4pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:10.2pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">7.5095373<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:16.25pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"93\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:70.1pt;border-right:1pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1pt solid windowtext;border-left:1pt solid windowtext;border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:16.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">hn11_880_site<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"79\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:59.4pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:16.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">Half-normal<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"172\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:129.3pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:16.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">~size+as.factor(Region.Label)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"80\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:59.75pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:16.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">0.02275416<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"79\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:59.4pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:16.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">0.4836787<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"80\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:59.75pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:16.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">0.02337893 <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"79\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:59.4pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:windowtext;border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:windowtext;padding:0cm 5.4pt;height:16.25pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt\">8.1723451<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I would\r\nlike to be sure that CvM p values are enough to think that the model anything\r\nbetter with half normal function<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I excuse\r\nmyself again because these questions might be pretty simple for the scope of\r\nthis group.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Regards</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Antonela <u></u><u></u></span></p></div>"
